  <!-- ==================== 本源 ==================== -->
  <GeneDef ParentName="LP_OozeGeneBase">
    <defName>LP_OozeCore</defName>
    <label>流浆之躯</label>
    <description>身体是一团会思考的原生质，没有骨骼也没有固定的器官位置。钝器打上去只会陷进去，强酸也溶不动它；伤口会自己合拢，不会感染、也不会留下疤痕，失血也比常人慢。带这条基因的人算作流浆人。</description>
    <iconPath>Oozefolk/Genes/OozeCore</iconPath>
    <biostatCpx>2</biostatCpx>
    <biostatMet>-2</biostatMet>
    <statOffsets>
      <ToxicResistance>0.5</ToxicResistance>
      <ToxicEnvironmentResistance>0.5</ToxicEnvironmentResistance>
    </statOffsets>
    <damageFactors>
      <Blunt>0.5</Blunt>
    </damageFactors>
    <customEffectDescriptions>
      <li>算作流浆人（吞没、分裂、稳形护带、种族判定）。</li>
      <li>酸蚀伤害：×25%（伤害名含 Acid 的全部，包括强酸瓶和其他模组的酸）。</li>
      <li>出血速度：×50%。</li>
      <li>伤口不会感染，旧伤不会变成永久伤疤。</li>
      <li>夺心魔蝌蚪无法寄生（会被溶解）。</li>
    </customEffectDescriptions>
  </GeneDef>

  <GeneDef ParentName="LP_OozeGeneBase">
    <defName>LP_OozeProtoplasm</defName>
    <label>原生质</label>
    <description>体内储存着可以随意调用的原生质。提供“原生质”资源条（0～100，开局30，不会自然流失）：吃饭、吞没尸体可以补充，分裂、渗过、重塑和析出凝胶都要消耗。</description>
    <geneClass>LichPhylactery.Gene_OozeProtoplasm</geneClass>
    <resourceGizmoType>LichPhylactery.GeneGizmo_OozeProtoplasm</resourceGizmoType>
    <resourceLabel>原生质</resourceLabel>
    <resourceGizmoThresholds>
      <li>0.1</li>
      <li>0.25</li>
      <li>0.4</li>
      <li>0.8</li>
    </resourceGizmoThresholds>
    <showGizmoOnWorldView>true</showGizmoOnWorldView>
    <showGizmoWhenDrafted>true</showGizmoWhenDrafted>
    <resourceDescription>流浆人体内可以调用的原生质。吃饭、吞没尸体补充；分裂、渗过、重塑、析出凝胶消耗。不会自然流失。</resourceDescription>
    <iconPath>Oozefolk/Genes/Protoplasm</iconPath>
    <biostatMet>0</biostatMet>
    <abilities>
      <li>LP_OozeReshape</li>
      <li>LP_OozeExtractGel</li>
    </abilities>
    <descriptionHyperlinks>
      <AbilityDef>LP_OozeReshape</AbilityDef>
      <AbilityDef>LP_OozeExtractGel</AbilityDef>
    </descriptionHyperlinks>
    <customEffectDescriptions>
      <li>原生质上限100（佩戴稳形护带120），开局30，不会自然流失。</li>
    </customEffectDescriptions>
  </GeneDef>

  <GeneDef ParentName="LP_OozeGeneBase">
    <defName>LP_OozeDigest</defName>
    <label>万物消化</label>
    <description>胃就是全身。什么都能化开：不会食物中毒，吃生食也不在乎；每吃一顿饭还能多攒一点原生质。能把一整具尸体“吞没”进身体里慢慢消化。</description>
    <geneClass>LichPhylactery.Gene_OozeDigest</geneClass>
    <iconPath>Oozefolk/Genes/Digest</iconPath>
    <biostatMet>-1</biostatMet>
    <statFactors>
      <FoodPoisonChance>0</FoodPoisonChance>
    </statFactors>
    <abilities>
      <li>LP_OozeEngulf</li>
    </abilities>
    <descriptionHyperlinks>
      <AbilityDef>LP_OozeEngulf</AbilityDef>
    </descriptionHyperlinks>
    <customEffectDescriptions>
      <li>不会因吃生食不开心。</li>
      <li>每吃一顿：原生质+3。</li>
    </customEffectDescriptions>
  </GeneDef>

  <GeneDef ParentName="LP_OozeGeneBase">
    <defName>LP_OozePseudopod</defName>
    <label>伪足</label>
    <description>可以随时从身上甩出一条带酸液的伪足当鞭子抽人，衣服被酸液泡过坏得特别快。双手都没了也能用伪足干活，操作能力不会低于60%。</description>
    <geneClass>LichPhylactery.Gene_LinkedHediff</geneClass>
    <iconPath>Oozefolk/Genes/Pseudopod</iconPath>
    <displayCategory>Violence</displayCategory>
    <biostatMet>-1</biostatMet>
    <customEffectDescriptions>
      <li>获得“酸性伪足”近战攻击：钝击9点＋酸蚀4点，冷却2秒；酸蚀对被击中者身上衣物的损伤×200%。</li>
      <li>操作能力不低于60%（但不超过意识水平）。</li>
    </customEffectDescriptions>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="LichPhylactery.LinkedHediffExtension">
        <hediff>LP_OozeLash</hediff>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </GeneDef>
