  <ScenarioDef ParentName="ScenarioBase">
    <defName>LP_OozeScenario</defName>
    <label>实验池逃亡</label>
    <description>塞伊的红袍法师在地下实验室里养着一池原生质，想把它们培育成听话的仆役。三个流浆人在一次失败的实验里有了自己的意识，溶开池壁的封印，带着一点能抢到的东西逃了出来。\n\n其中一人在实验池里多泡了几天，开局原生质有60；另外带着凝胶敷料、强酸瓶和一条稳形护带。流浆人不怕感染、什么都能吃，能吞没尸体、分裂繁衍；但很怕冷。大约第6天，塞伊会派一支小追捕队（约300点）来把实验品抓回去。\n\n注意：三人都很怕冷，冬天来得早的地方要先解决取暖；追捕队不强但来得快，属于中等难度。</description>
    <scenario>
      <summary>三名从塞伊实验池里逃出来的流浆人；第6天红袍的追捕队就会找上门。</summary>
      <parts>

        <li Class="ScenPart_ConfigPage_ConfigureStartingPawns_Xenotypes">
          <def>ConfigurePawnsXenotypes</def>
          <pawnChoiceCount>8</pawnChoiceCount>
          <customSummary>三名流浆人。</customSummary>
          <xenotypeCounts>
            <li>
              <xenotype>LP_Oozefolk</xenotype>
              <count>3</count>
              <description>流浆人</description>
              <requiredAtStart>true</requiredAtStart>
              <allowedDevelopmentalStages>Adult</allowedDevelopmentalStages>
            </li>
          </xenotypeCounts>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_PlayerPawnsArriveMethod">
          <def>PlayerPawnsArriveMethod</def>
          <visible>false</visible>
          <method>Standing</method>
        </li>

        <li Class="LichPhylactery.ScenPart_OozeEscape">
          <def>LP_OozeEscape</def>
          <protoplasm>60</protoplasm>
          <raidDay>6</raidDay>
          <raidPoints>300</raidPoints>
          <letterLabel>实验池的追捕者</letterLabel>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>LP_GelDressing</thingDef>
          <count>10</count>
        </li>
        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>LP_AcidVial</thingDef>
          <count>4</count>
        </li>
        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>MealSurvivalPack</thingDef>
          <count>30</count>
        </li>
        <li Class="ScenPart_StartingThing_Defined">
          <def>StartingThing_Defined</def>
          <thingDef>LP_StabilizerBand</thingDef>
          <stuff>Leather_Plain</stuff>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart">
          <def>ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart</def>
          <thingDef>Steel</thingDef>
          <count>200</count>
        </li>
        <li Class="ScenPart_ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart">
          <def>ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart</def>
          <thingDef>WoodLog</thingDef>
          <count>300</count>
        </li>
        <li Class="ScenPart_ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart">
          <def>ScatterThingsNearPlayerStart</def>
          <thingDef>Cloth</thingDef>
          <count>60</count>
        </li>

        <li Class="ScenPart_GameStartDialog">
          <def>GameStartDialog</def>
          <text>池壁的符文熄灭的那一刻，你们第一次知道了“自己”是什么意思。\n\n你们从排水沟里流出实验室，一路渗过三道上锁的门，在荒野里重新捏出了人形。身后，红袍法师的咒骂声还在回荡——他们不会让珍贵的实验品就这么跑掉。\n\n找个暖和的地方。尽快。</text>
          <closeSound>GameStartSting</closeSound>
        </li>

      </parts>
    </scenario>
  </ScenarioDef>
</Defs>
